WEBVTT

00:06.400 --> 00:08.250
This isn't what we agreed on, Ichiya!

00:08.250 --> 00:10.490
Why did you transfer to him?!

00:10.990 --> 00:14.900
Of course I will always choose 
the strongest host.

00:14.900 --> 00:16.000
Furthermore,

00:16.510 --> 00:21.500
Asamine Matakara carries within himself 
a darkness of immeasurable depth.

00:21.500 --> 00:23.800
Huh?! Cut the bullshit!

00:23.800 --> 00:25.250
Have you been lying to me?!

00:25.550 --> 00:27.170
Why should you care?

00:27.170 --> 00:30.760
Be thankful you got out of it 
without having your body taken over.

00:30.760 --> 00:34.360
Taken over? What in the world 
are you talking about?

00:35.710 --> 00:38.510
That is no longer any of your concern.

00:46.610 --> 00:49.450
I have no use for such a weak vessel.

02:33.480 --> 02:35.510
Good morning, Mahoro-chan!

02:35.510 --> 02:40.300
I'm almost done engraving the new seal. 
Are you free tomorrow?

02:35.630 --> 02:41.020
<b>#09 Temptation! Soup-Related Etceteras!</b>

02:42.250 --> 02:43.900
If that doesn't work, the day after?

02:43.900 --> 02:44.890
I'm good.

02:44.890 --> 02:47.730
Um, is that a yes or a no?

02:47.730 --> 02:49.900
Where the hell could Matakara be?

02:49.900 --> 02:52.600
He's been gone for three days already.

02:52.600 --> 02:54.900
Check his place on the way home again?

02:54.900 --> 03:00.740
I just don't like the lady there. 
She always acts so uptight.

03:01.100 --> 03:03.280
Yeah, 'cause he's crashing there for free.

03:03.900 --> 03:07.920
He really was looking forward to 
moving in with his brother.

03:16.420 --> 03:18.050
What? For real?

03:18.050 --> 03:19.130
For real, for real!

03:19.130 --> 03:20.510
Yeah, it was perfect!

03:20.510 --> 03:22.730
Haven't seen that Emperor in a while.

03:22.730 --> 03:24.550
Maybe he's dead or something.

03:26.050 --> 03:28.600
And after pushing us around all that time.

03:28.930 --> 03:31.940
We'll make sure he doesn't get 
that full of himself again.

03:31.940 --> 03:34.420
Yay!

03:37.950 --> 03:39.860
Thanks for comin' in.

03:40.610 --> 03:43.700
I wonder where Matakara went off to.

03:44.620 --> 03:47.580
You didn't need to tell him off like that.

03:47.580 --> 03:51.230
Huh?! I was sick and tired of his crap!

03:51.230 --> 03:53.840
It was a relief to get that off my chest.

03:58.530 --> 04:01.660
Heave-and-a-ho!

04:03.120 --> 04:06.310
That was pretty weak. One more go!

04:06.310 --> 04:08.750
I... hey! Wait a—

04:06.980 --> 04:08.750
Heave...

04:08.750 --> 04:10.430
Oh, my!

04:10.430 --> 04:11.190
Huh?

04:11.190 --> 04:13.190
<b>Aabar Bath</b>

04:13.510 --> 04:16.930
Hey. Um, is Matakara-kun here?

04:17.300 --> 04:19.900
Well, he did come back, but—

04:19.900 --> 04:22.290
What?! Thanks!

04:22.290 --> 04:23.740
W-Wait!

04:28.900 --> 04:30.460
Matakara!

04:30.460 --> 04:34.210
Where the hell were you? 
You had us worried, man.

04:35.040 --> 04:38.310
That's really terrible... about your brother.

04:38.310 --> 04:42.830
Try to cheer up! Look, I brought 
your favorite gyoza bento!

04:44.470 --> 04:46.270
Hey, hold on...

04:50.390 --> 04:53.190
Where are you going? Hey!

04:54.820 --> 04:55.860
Matakara!

04:56.390 --> 04:58.410
You'd better come to school tomorrow!

05:12.280 --> 05:13.880
Welcome in!

05:14.680 --> 05:16.980
Um, so for today...

05:16.980 --> 05:18.380
Pu'er-chan, please.

05:19.840 --> 05:23.640
Are you... tired of Jasmine-chan now?

05:23.640 --> 05:24.680
Huh?

05:25.030 --> 05:28.150
I know she can be strong-willed and clingy.

05:28.150 --> 05:30.280
She can be a little too much at times.

05:30.280 --> 05:31.390
But...

05:31.970 --> 05:36.150
Even when you were with other girls, 
she kept waiting for you to come!

05:39.180 --> 05:41.900
Please, let me ask you one more time.

05:42.290 --> 05:44.160
Who will it be today?

05:45.390 --> 05:48.040
I would like Jasmine-chan, please.

05:48.040 --> 05:52.410
All right! Jasmine-chan, he's come home!

05:53.150 --> 05:58.930
I've been acting like such a fool. 
I doubt you'll ever forgive me at this point.

05:58.930 --> 06:01.650
But... But you...

06:01.650 --> 06:04.420
You're the only one for me, Jasmine-chan!

06:05.440 --> 06:09.540
Jeez, what timing for our bath to get busted.

06:09.540 --> 06:11.270
Are you going to Matakara's place?

06:11.640 --> 06:15.230
Where else? That's the only 
public bath nearby.

06:15.230 --> 06:17.240
And Matakara might be back by now!

06:17.240 --> 06:19.230
I told you, that's got nothing 
to do with me—

06:20.600 --> 06:21.460
Ow...

06:23.190 --> 06:24.320
Matakara.

06:27.900 --> 06:32.970
Yeah, uh... our bath is broken, 
so I'm going to your place.

06:41.590 --> 06:43.010
I will never forgive you.

06:45.040 --> 06:49.250
I will never forgive you for this. 
I'll destroy everything!

07:00.480 --> 07:02.480
<b>Honki</b>

07:04.920 --> 07:09.790
Matakara looked like he was in a hurry. 
Where do you think he's going?

07:11.110 --> 07:12.200
How would I know?

07:16.210 --> 07:17.430
Ara-pyon?

07:18.170 --> 07:19.650
It's me, it's me!

07:19.650 --> 07:22.600
Um, and who might that be?

07:24.060 --> 07:25.870
It's Komao, man!

07:25.870 --> 07:29.180
Ooh! Nice slap mark you got there!

07:29.180 --> 07:30.390
I'll scrub it off for you!

07:30.390 --> 07:30.720
Huh?!

07:30.720 --> 07:33.320
Rub-a-dub-dub!

07:31.610 --> 07:33.320
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

07:35.230 --> 07:37.890
Ow...

07:35.230 --> 07:40.540
I'm so happy I got to see him! Yay!

07:40.540 --> 07:43.850
Bam bam, ba-ba-ba, ba-ba, ba-bam!

07:40.880 --> 07:41.970
Hey.

07:43.040 --> 07:44.740
Zabu... kun?

07:43.850 --> 07:48.350
Maybe he'll come back to school tomorrow!

07:44.740 --> 07:46.100
Barf.

07:47.140 --> 07:48.950
Did you see Matakara?

07:48.350 --> 07:51.850
Bam bam, da-da-da, di-di-di-di, day!

07:48.950 --> 07:50.310
Kind of.

07:50.310 --> 07:51.850
Did he say anything to you?

07:51.850 --> 07:53.280
Not really.

07:54.300 --> 07:56.250
Wouldn't it be best to just leave him alone?

07:57.230 --> 08:01.630
The way he is now, I think 
that'd be a real bad idea.

08:04.380 --> 08:07.690
What an awful guy! Ba-ba-bam, oh yeah!

08:07.690 --> 08:12.060
Bam bam, ba-ba-ba-ba, ba-ba-ba bam! Banzai!

08:15.720 --> 08:19.040
Look, Big Brother! We have matching cups!

08:20.220 --> 08:22.040
I'll pour you some yummy black tea.

08:22.450 --> 08:24.870
Trickle, trickle, trickle.

08:28.460 --> 08:30.180
Delicious, isn't it?

08:30.180 --> 08:32.820
What?! Asamine Mitsukuni did?

08:33.280 --> 08:35.400
Are you serious right now?

08:34.090 --> 08:35.060
Swoosh!

08:35.570 --> 08:36.810
Yeah.

08:36.810 --> 08:38.870
I don't know the details either,

08:39.280 --> 08:43.040
but it sounds like he got stabbed 
trying to stop a fight in juvie.

08:43.040 --> 08:48.050
The guy who was once head of Minato 
isn't supposed to just drop dead!

08:48.970 --> 08:50.580
<i>Who are they talking about?</i>

08:52.000 --> 08:55.680
Even Doman couldn't beat him. 
He was a legend.

08:56.240 --> 08:58.560
Matakara must really be suffering right now.

08:59.190 --> 09:01.440
What are you bringing him up for?

09:01.440 --> 09:03.980
Because he's Mitsukuni's 
kid brother, obviously!

09:03.980 --> 09:05.730
His kid brother?!

09:18.370 --> 09:19.500
What's up?

09:20.370 --> 09:22.340
Oh, nothing.

09:23.560 --> 09:27.490
No kidding. So he's Asamine's little brother.

09:27.490 --> 09:29.630
And that was his only blood relative.

09:30.380 --> 09:35.140
Looks like he hasn't been going to school, 
either. He must be really messed up.

09:45.660 --> 09:47.800
What are you so afraid of?

10:12.000 --> 10:16.920
He embodies the weakness in your heart. 
Your desire to run away.

10:18.010 --> 10:20.600
I will free you from him.

10:21.130 --> 10:25.940
Once you acquire true strength, 
he will disappear and be gone forever.

10:29.590 --> 10:30.700
You're lying.

10:31.840 --> 10:33.460
Why do you say that?

10:36.460 --> 10:41.200
After Ara-chan left me, I already 
tried to make myself stronger.

10:42.670 --> 10:43.770
But...

10:45.010 --> 10:46.340
That thing...

10:50.720 --> 10:54.220
The monster never disappeared.

10:56.930 --> 11:00.100
Are you sure you continued 
to pursue true strength?

11:00.570 --> 11:03.070
Did you defeat all and rise to the top?

11:04.380 --> 11:05.850
Well, I...

11:06.450 --> 11:09.300
Are you sure you did not give up?

11:24.620 --> 11:25.500
But...

11:26.560 --> 11:30.200
The guys... They all accepted me.

11:31.550 --> 11:35.420
Friends offer nothing 
but comfort for the weak.

11:35.940 --> 11:39.010
They are useless for those training 
to become Honki People.

11:39.010 --> 11:40.660
I don't believe that.

11:43.010 --> 11:44.790
Furthermore,

11:44.790 --> 11:48.520
the source of your weakness 
right now is Tomoshibi Arajin.

11:50.100 --> 11:52.840
As long as you continue to rely on him,

11:52.840 --> 11:56.530
you will never become a Honki Person, 
and the monster will never disappear.

11:57.580 --> 12:00.010
You must defeat Tomoshibi Arajin.

12:02.550 --> 12:04.740
"I'm good," she said.

12:05.270 --> 12:07.390
So does she want it or not?

12:07.390 --> 12:10.040
Obviously it means she doesn't.

12:10.040 --> 12:12.860
I mean, who would want a
dumb rock like that anyway?

12:12.860 --> 12:14.080
Lots of people!

12:16.410 --> 12:17.670
Well, one person.

12:23.080 --> 12:26.560
So there is someone out there 
who really does get you.

12:27.000 --> 12:28.250
Arajin-kun?

12:34.940 --> 12:36.970
Sorry I ever doubted you.

12:36.970 --> 12:39.650
Now, as promised, a lake blue soapstone—

12:38.740 --> 12:41.170
Is Matakara-kun all right?

12:41.590 --> 12:43.960
Huh? Matakara?

12:44.340 --> 12:47.620
I heard he's been really depressed 
since his brother passed away.

12:47.940 --> 12:49.830
Uh, yeah.

12:50.550 --> 12:52.030
I...

12:52.030 --> 12:54.740
I understand how he feels 
so strongly it hurts!

12:55.380 --> 12:58.600
Almost as if... it happened to me.

13:00.990 --> 13:05.610
D-D-Does that mean you've been... 
th-th-th-thinking about Matakara?

13:07.700 --> 13:11.190
But listen, that stuff is his problem. 
It's none of our—

13:11.190 --> 13:12.440
Arajin-kun.

13:14.370 --> 13:17.930
Have you ever once considered 
Matakara-kun's feelings?

13:18.540 --> 13:19.320
Huh?

13:20.200 --> 13:24.910
Unbelievable! Don't talk to 
me again until you have.

13:30.890 --> 13:34.630
Mahoro-chan is into Matakara? 
I can't believe it.

13:34.630 --> 13:37.620
Hey, you okay? Hey!

13:37.620 --> 13:39.630
Shut up! I'm not in the mood for that!

13:40.150 --> 13:42.880
Okay, then, it sounds like 
you need a little push!

13:42.880 --> 13:44.340
Heave—

13:44.720 --> 13:46.510
You think I'm gonna fall for that again?

13:46.820 --> 13:48.270
A.J.

13:50.010 --> 13:55.690
You guys sure do get along. 
I'm so jealous of you.

13:56.210 --> 13:57.890
Can I help you with something?

13:57.890 --> 14:01.710
Wait. I already asked you, 
but how do you know about Sen—

14:02.120 --> 14:04.200
You'll find out soon enough.

14:08.080 --> 14:09.410
Bye.

14:10.230 --> 14:12.750
Hey. He say something to you?

14:12.750 --> 14:13.800
No.

14:16.030 --> 14:19.420
If you defeat Arajin, you will be reborn.

14:19.750 --> 14:22.230
You will be released 
from the monster's grasp.

14:24.210 --> 14:28.680
But... I can't do something like that.

14:29.040 --> 14:33.690
Why not? Hasn't Arajin been 
deceiving you all this time?

14:36.910 --> 14:42.190
Even now, using Senya's power, 
he continues to deceive you.

14:45.790 --> 14:49.450
Why? How could you, Ara-chan?

14:52.760 --> 14:55.400
I am the only one who can save you.

14:55.940 --> 14:59.960
I will make you into a Honki Person 
and release you from the monster's grasp.

15:00.350 --> 15:03.470
Now, you must defeat Arajin.

15:06.350 --> 15:10.450
Aw, come on. 
When is our bath gonna get fixed?

15:10.450 --> 15:13.180
But big baths feel great, don't they?

15:13.180 --> 15:15.770
And you might even run into Matakara there.

15:16.730 --> 15:18.250
Listen...

15:18.250 --> 15:20.730
Why are you always talking about him, anyway?

15:22.250 --> 15:23.740
How do I put this?

15:24.050 --> 15:26.950
Seeing you guys together 
brings back memories.

15:29.060 --> 15:33.770
I also trained with another guy 
to become Honki People.

15:47.390 --> 15:52.390
When I first met him, he was 
facing a much bigger opponent,

15:52.940 --> 15:55.850
and he took him down with just one kick!

16:07.750 --> 16:10.800
I decided I wanted to 
become strong like that.

16:17.100 --> 16:20.040
I admired him and his desire to become Honki,

16:20.040 --> 16:22.910
so I also made it my goal 
to become a Honki Person.

16:25.670 --> 16:26.880
Heave-ho!

16:41.320 --> 16:42.610
Senya.

16:43.070 --> 16:44.940
From now on, that is your name.

16:48.360 --> 16:51.090
My... name?

16:53.500 --> 16:57.620
He meant absolutely everything to me.

16:58.680 --> 16:59.900
But then...

17:04.480 --> 17:08.370
So I want you guys to stay 
the way you are forever.

17:08.790 --> 17:10.130
What kind of story is that?

17:10.610 --> 17:12.290
Well, what I mean is,

17:12.290 --> 17:16.060
if you're training to be Honki with someone, 
you gotta have each other's backs.

17:16.060 --> 17:18.210
I have no clue what you mean.

17:18.210 --> 17:21.990
But you and Matakara did try 
to become Honki People, right?

17:21.990 --> 17:24.650
Yeah, but that was when we were kids.

17:26.040 --> 17:31.400
You know, at first I really wondered 
why I got stuck on a guy like you.

17:32.410 --> 17:35.840
Then I realized how blindly, 
even stupidly determined you are,

17:35.840 --> 17:38.610
and that's something Honki 
People can really relate to.

17:39.550 --> 17:43.450
I see that determination 
in you... and I like it.

17:46.610 --> 17:49.210
I don't need to hear that from a guy.

17:50.530 --> 17:51.810
And Matakara...

17:51.810 --> 17:56.640
I bet he decided to become a Honki Person 
because he was drawn to that part of you.

17:58.280 --> 17:59.330
Ara-chan.

18:03.200 --> 18:04.980
I want you to fight me.

18:05.450 --> 18:06.980
Matakara?

18:07.410 --> 18:10.260
I have to become a Honki Person...

18:10.870 --> 18:11.780
or else!

18:11.780 --> 18:12.400
Huh?!

18:17.070 --> 18:19.040
What the hell are you doing, Matakara?!

18:21.730 --> 18:22.500
Arajin!

18:22.500 --> 18:25.410
This is too dangerous. Let's merge!

18:27.770 --> 18:31.440
I want to lose my virginity!

18:32.890 --> 18:35.430
Bucchigiri!

18:39.640 --> 18:41.290
I have to beat him!

18:42.360 --> 18:45.100
I have to beat Ara-chan...

18:45.100 --> 18:46.900
or else!

18:50.690 --> 18:55.460
What are you doing? Do you want 
to be devoured by the monster?

18:58.470 --> 18:59.450
No way!

19:01.500 --> 19:04.330
<i>With that kind of power, there's no question.</i>

19:04.910 --> 19:07.530
<i>Ichiya has transferred into Matakara!</i>

19:08.530 --> 19:12.760
C-Cut it out! What's wrong 
with you, Matakara?

19:13.680 --> 19:17.760
You have to fight me. Don't run away.

19:33.110 --> 19:35.360
It's gonna blow!

19:40.550 --> 19:43.620
I don't know what's happening anymore,

19:44.060 --> 19:45.240
Brother.

19:46.420 --> 19:50.310
<i>That kindness is preventing him 
from becoming totally ruthless.</i>

19:53.130 --> 19:55.580
Ow, ow, ow.

19:58.210 --> 20:00.790
What was he trying to do?

20:01.950 --> 20:05.390
Ichiya has possessed Matakara.

20:05.890 --> 20:07.910
Who the hell is Ichiya?

20:08.800 --> 20:11.410
Are you hiding something from me?

20:11.780 --> 20:15.530
Hey! What do you mean 
Matakara is <i>possessed</i>?!

20:15.530 --> 20:17.910
What the hell do you want from me any—

20:19.090 --> 20:21.000
Hey! Senya?

20:21.000 --> 20:21.880
Senya!

20:34.820 --> 20:36.020
You came.

20:41.010 --> 20:42.360
Where's Senya?

20:42.360 --> 20:45.460
Who knows? He won't come out right now.

20:47.150 --> 20:48.520
Did something happen?

20:48.520 --> 20:51.770
More importantly, what's this stuff 
about Senya's "secret"?

20:56.240 --> 21:00.050
I'll tell you what his true objective is.

21:00.520 --> 21:04.280
What Senya wants is your body.

21:04.280 --> 21:06.900
To take over your body.

21:09.610 --> 21:12.830
Brother, what should I do?

21:13.650 --> 21:18.550
You are a coward. Just like 
your brother before you.

21:19.960 --> 21:21.180
What do you mean by that?

21:21.180 --> 21:25.680
Your older brother was a coward 
who couldn't protect his family.

21:26.500 --> 21:29.550
You don't know anything about my brother.

21:29.550 --> 21:32.190
My brother was every bit 
as strong as a Honki Person!

21:34.000 --> 21:36.440
He was nothing at all like a Honki Person!

21:36.840 --> 21:38.190
Shut up.

21:38.190 --> 21:40.150
He was nothing but a fake.

21:40.620 --> 21:41.530
Shut up!

21:41.530 --> 21:44.030
He died because he was weak.

21:44.030 --> 21:46.280
Shut up!

21:54.160 --> 21:57.250
The monster... disappeared.

21:57.750 --> 22:01.950
That's right. The thing you lack is anger.

22:02.350 --> 22:06.760
Now, dive headfirst into a 
whirlpool of anger and hate.

22:07.400 --> 22:12.400
And then slay that fool 
Arajin who deceived you!

23:45.030 --> 23:50.400
<b>Fallen Friend!</b>

23:45.030 --> 23:50.400
<b>This Love, This Pain, This Almond Tofu!</b>

23:45.830 --> 23:47.970
Next week, we're gonna Bucchigi-you hard!
